# `hilavitkutin-providers`

Default Resource-backed providers for the hilavitkutin scheduler.
Standalone ecosystem crate; consumed by the engine via Kit
installation or direct `builder.with(...)` wiring, no reverse
dependency. Ships `InternerKit` (an inline-storage `MemoryArena`
wrapped by `StringInterner`), the `ArenaColumnStorage` column store,
`StaticBumpMemory`, a memory provider over a buffer the consumer hands
it, and the adapt kits `StandardAdaptKit` and `OffAdaptKit` with their
per-axis metrics resources. A default clock and an operating-system
memory provider are not in it; the engine's `platform-os` feature
carries `OsClock` and `OsMemoryProvider`.
